
# Pimbra patches - BEGIN

## Pimbra org
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = maldua-pimbra.url-prefix=https://github.com/maldua-pimbra

## zm-web-client
### Select Advanced Classic by default in login page.
### This avoids having submission errors when a logged-in user refreshes the page.
###
### Fix: Crafted email can run malicious script. (10.1.19)
###
### ZCS 10.1.20 ZWC XSS Fix. (1)
###
### Fix 10.1.20: Allow malicious attachment filenames to execute script under specific conditions.
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-web-client.remote=maldua-pimbra
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-web-client.tag=10.1.18.p1-maldua

## zm-ajax
### ZCS 10.1.20 ZWC XSS Fix. (3)
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-ajax.remote=maldua-pimbra
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-ajax.tag=10.1.18.p1-maldua

## zm-build
### SNMP CVE mitigation (2026-06)
### This is applied directly in zm-build itself so not need to override its git repo

# Pimbra patches - END

